From: drzee99 <drzee99@archlinux.org>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 21:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix: add metainfo_file dependency to compile_resources

Fixes a build race where glib-compile-resources runs before the
metainfo XML is generated by i18n merge.

---
 data/meson.build | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/data/meson.build b/data/meson.build
index abcdefg..1234567 100644
--- a/data/meson.build
+++ b/data/meson.build
@@ -15,7 +15,8 @@ break_timer_resources = gnome.compile_resources(
     ),
     source_dir: meson.current_build_dir(),
     c_name: 'gnome_break_timer_resources',
     dependencies: [
-        blueprints
+        blueprints,
+        metainfo_file
     ]
 )
